  - The 47 newest reports are byte-exact, reviewed, ledgered, and routed by the decision index. They are advisory, not execution evidence.
  - MemoryEndpoints direct agent coordination and the TinyRustLM.com Connect user plugin are separate authorized lanes. Synchronized redundant prelaunch memory is allowed.
  - No model, browser, P2P, live memory, deployment, or publication claim exists beyond exact named receipts; counters remain zero.
  - Next implement the real exclusive restart-safe source owner, then wire operation/transfer, load the sole client, and delete the old bridge/one-file flow.
  - Commit and push every coherent green major change; deploy every affected site whenever its complete gate passes.
